Z||000000||DaveL||06-21-2001||08:46 AM||||Well, it finally happened. This morning on the way to work, I got about an eighth of a mile from my house, when the constant ticking in my 87 2.5 SE turned suddenly into a loud clatter. I heard a muffled sort of pow, then it coughed and died. Big cloud of white smoke from the exhaust, and it won't even turn over. Very definitely something inside the engine I'm sure...<P>Now the scary part, you can't really tell what happened till you open up the engine. DAM ! Now I'm trying to decide whether to rebuild, or park it and buy another $1000 bomb. Maybe my last post.....going down for the third time....||||reg||9
